    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d401">

                <pb facs="0536" n="456" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg456"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Prince Devawongse,
                        Minister for Foreign Affairs, to Mr. Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bangkok</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-16"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>His Majesty was deeply grieved to hear of the death of President McKinley, and
                    commanded me to express through your excellency to the American nation his
                    profound sympathy and that of his Government at this irreparable loss.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Devawongse</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Minister Foreign Affairs.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
